    axes: { harm: 0, pitch: 1, ornament: 0, meter: 0, density: 2, transmission: 1, improv: 0, soundTech: 2, intensity: 1, voice: -1, timbre: 2, percussion: 1, cyclicity: 2 },
    description: 'Mid-90s Indian-beach-scene trance ancestor of psytrance; phrygian-and-harmonic-minor melodic-modal vocabulary, layered analog-synth arpeggios over four-on-floor kick, sample-collage Indian-and-mystic vocal fragments.',
    exemplars: ['Astral Projection', 'Hallucinogen', 'Etnica'],
    status: 'documented',
