    description: '2010s mainstream Nashville country radio sound; pedal-steel-and-fiddle preserved as country-signifier alongside arena-rock-derived production, romantic-lifestyle lyric subjects, polished-and-radio-optimized arrangement.',
    exemplars: ['Carrie Underwood', 'Blake Shelton', 'Miranda Lambert'],
