    axes: { harm: 1, pitch: 1, ornament: 0, meter: 0, density: 1, transmission: 1, improv: 0, soundTech: 0, intensity: 2, voice: 2, timbre: 1, percussion: 1, cyclicity: -1 },
    description: 'Early-1970s English heavy-blues-rock-derived classic doom-metal sub-style; slow-tempo down-tuned riffing, melodic-vocal delivery, dirge-like song structures, gothic-pessimist lyric subjects, occult-and-fantastic imagery.',
