    description: 'Late-2000s-and-2010s house subgenre returning to Chicago-acid-house-derived "jacking" bouncy bass-line aesthetic. Characterized by funky cut-and-paste vocal-sampling, prominent off-beat bass-pulse, and 1990s deep-house-influenced groove. UK producers Mark Knight, Hatiras, the broader Toolroom Records label, and American producers Chocolate Puma, Detroit Swindle, and Jesse Rose anchored the canonical sound.',
