    description: 'Mid-2010s vaporwave subgenre evoking the atmosphere of 1980s-1990s American suburban shopping malls through extensive reverb-processed Muzak-and-elevator-music sampling, distant-and-ghostly atmospheric production, and explicit retail-space liminality thematic content. ░▒▓ 컴퓨터 데이터 ▓▒░, Disconscious, Cat System Corp., and the broader Bandcamp-distributed mallsoft scene anchor the canonical aesthetic.',
