    axes: { harm: 1, pitch: 1, ornament: 1, meter: 1, density: 1, transmission: 1, improv: 1, soundTech: 0, intensity: 2, voice: 2, timbre: 1, percussion: 2, cyclicity: 0 },
    description: 'Early-2010s revival of late-1990s midwest emo aesthetic through new bands continuing the Cap\'n Jazz, American Football, and Promise Ring lineage. The World Is a Beautiful Place & I Am No Longer Afraid to Die (2009-onward), Algernon Cadwallader, Snowing, Joyce Manor, and the broader Topshelf Records and Run for Cover Records label rosters anchor the canonical roster. The 2014 American Football reunion and 1999-album re-release consolidated the revival\'s historical lineage.',
