    description: '2010s heavy-metal subgenre integrating black-metal extreme-vocal-and-percussion aggression with shoegaze-and-post-rock textural-and-melodic-arrangement. Alcest (France, 2000-onward) inaugurated the canonical sound; Deafheaven\'s Sunbather (2013) consolidated international visibility and the broader 2010s blackgaze wave through Bosse-de-Nage, Astronoid, Underling, and adjacent acts. Distinguished from atmospheric black metal by blackgaze\'s explicit shoegaze-textural-influence and major-key/melodic-emphasis.',
