  "metalcore_espanol": {"parent":"distortedRock.metal","axes":{"harm":0,"pitch":0,"ornament":0,"meter":0,"density":1,"transmission":-1,"improv":0,"soundTech":1,"intensity":2,"voice":1,"timbre":1,"percussion":1,"cyclicity":0},"description":"Down-tuned palm-muted guitar and bass unisons alternate quick drum drive with half-time breakdowns. Urgent vocals need not be in Spanish; language and melodic emphasis vary among bands.","exemplars":["Become Wrath — Skirmish"],"status":"documented","crossRefs":[]},
  "metal_cristao": {"parent":"distortedRock.metal","axes":{"harm":0,"pitch":0,"ornament":0,"meter":0,"density":1,"transmission":-1,"improv":0,"soundTech":1,"intensity":2,"voice":1,"timbre":1,"percussion":1,"cyclicity":0},"description":"Christian lyrical themes accompany compact distorted riffs, bass reinforcement and rapid drum bursts in the death/grind branch. Religious identity is expressed through words and community rather than a fixed acoustic signature.","exemplars":["Antidemon — Apocalypsenow-era trio (2012)"],"status":"documented","crossRefs":[]},
  "metal_gotico": {"parent":"distortedRock.metal","axes":{"harm":1,"pitch":0,"ornament":0,"meter":0,"density":0,"transmission":-1,"improv":0,"soundTech":1,"intensity":2,"voice":1,"timbre":1,"percussion":1,"cyclicity":0},"description":"The metal gótico discovery grouping represented by the Duan Marie-fronted Mexican Anabanta practice documented in 2018–2019. This playlist-defined discovery label is represented here by a Mexican gothic-metal branch alongside the broader Gothic metal category. It does not reclassify all Spanish-language metal, conflate rock-goth and metal, or combine the different Anabanta/Anabantha lineups. Author a melodic lead vocal against sustained electric power chords, bass and a spacious acoustic kit, with dark dynamic contrasts and ringing guitar replies; no unsourced orchestral or operatic layer is compulsory. Pickup construction, tuning, playing variants, room, signal chain and numeric axes are authored choices, not claims about the exemplar’s session.","exemplars":["Anabanta — Duan Marie-fronted 2018–2019 practice"],"status":"documented","crossRefs":[]},
  "metal_guitar": {"parent":"distortedRock.metal.prog","axes":{"harm":1,"pitch":0,"ornament":2,"meter":1,"density":1,"transmission":-1,"improv":0,"soundTech":1,"intensity":2,"voice":-2,"timbre":1,"percussion":1,"cyclicity":0},"description":"Guitar-focused instrumental metal represented by James Norbert Ivanyi’s Sydney home-studio Denalavis. A performer/instrument-oriented discovery label, not a single geographic tradition or a synonym for all heavy metal. This instrumental progressive branch excludes a required vocalist while retaining documented bass, drums and keyboard roles. Author an exposed overdriven melodic guitar lead with detailed articulation over rhythm overdubs, bass and changing kit accents, using a restrained sustained synth layer for the credited keyboards. Analog-poly synthesis is an authored option, not an equipment claim. Pickup construction, tuning, playing variants, room, signal chain and numeric axes are authored choices, not claims about the exemplar’s session.","exemplars":["James Norbert Ivanyi — Denalavis"],"status":"documented","crossRefs":[]},
